{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsung Escape</i> is a vertical action-platformer where you outrun an ever-rising Void. Use Energy Orbs to gain movement abilities like double-jumps and dashes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies\u2014just pure platforming, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proto and Eye... or is it Eye and Proto?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Proto the heroic silent protagonist of Unsung Escape... but if you ask Eye he's the star of the game! Sassy and maybe a little unhinged from his time in The Null you never know what's going to come out of his <span class=\"bb_strike\">mouth</span>\u00a0or ummmm speaker? next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Vertical Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by the incredible Tyler Carr from the Energy 106 Morning Show with Dave Wheeler,\u00a0 Eye will definitely let you know how you're doing as you race up these procedurally generated vertical levels as you attempt to escape The Void constantly nipping at Proto's heels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for... Start Escaping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860790?t=1754503248","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860790/a6fef0e2507a6dcba501a90b61e546146fbb8a1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754503248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860790/473acb4bf2e8a65960cfbe33b5082c48f4b1b8c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754503248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860790/473acb4bf2e8a65960cfbe33b5082c48f4b1b8c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754503248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsung Escape</i> is a vertical action-platformer where you outrun an ever-rising Void. Use Energy Orbs to gain movement abilities like double-jumps and dashes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies\u2014just pure platforming, exploration, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proto and Eye... or is it Eye and Proto?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Proto the heroic silent protagonist of Unsung Escape... but if you ask Eye he's the star of the game! Sassy and maybe a little unhinged from his time in The Null you never know what's going to come out of his <span class=\"bb_strike\">mouth</span>\u00a0or ummmm speaker? next...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Vertical Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by the incredible Tyler Carr from the Energy 106 Morning Show with Dave Wheeler,\u00a0 Eye will definitely let you know how you're doing as you race up these procedurally generated vertical levels as you attempt to escape The Void constantly nipping at Proto's heels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you waiting for... Start Escaping...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ENEME INC."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea